{"id":"n84077-1-8","stage":5,"title":"한가롭다 · 闲暇","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n84077-1-8-1","ko":"이번 겨울 방학에는 무엇을 할 계획이니?","zh":"这个寒假你有什么计划吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"겨울","meaning":"冬天，冬季","explanation":"겨울：冬天，冬季","readings":[{"term":"겨울","audio":"/audio/ac9e69428d653c8c2b15.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64367","senseId":"1","lemma":"겨울","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"방학에는","meaning":"放假","explanation":"방학：放假；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"방학","audio":"/audio/236457354c2107a38d81.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20207","senseId":"1","lemma":"방학","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"무엇을","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무엇：什么；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"무엇","audio":"/audio/c95167f3fe21887b7320.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17199","senseId":"2","lemma":"무엇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"할","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"계획이니?","meaning":"计划，筹划","explanation":"계획：计划，筹划；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"계획","audio":"/audio/b0fe4ea3ac5ac4022d19.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23324","senseId":"1","lemma":"계획","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"ac9e69428d653c8c","term":"겨울","zh":"冬天，冬季","audio":"/audio/ac9e69428d653c8c2b15.mp3","entryId":"64367","definition":"四季中的一个，介于秋天和春天之间的寒冷的季节。","pronunciation":["겨울"]},{"id":"236457354c2107a3","term":"방학","zh":"放假","audio":"/audio/236457354c2107a38d81.mp3","entryId":"20207","definition":"学校里一个学期结束后在一定期间内停止课业；或那个期间。","pronunciation":["방ː학"]},{"id":"c95167f3fe21887b","term":"무엇","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/c95167f3fe21887b7320.mp3","entryId":"17199","definition":"指代不确定或不需要明指的对象。","pronunciation":["무얻"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"b0fe4ea3ac5ac402","term":"계획","zh":"计划，筹划","audio":"/audio/b0fe4ea3ac5ac4022d19.mp3","entryId":"23324","definition":"仔细考虑并决定将来的事情。","pronunciation":["계ː획","게ː훽"]}],"audio":"/audio/80d2e22ce9f861fc04ff.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n84077-1-8-2","ko":"집에서 한가롭게 책을 읽으며 쉬고 싶어요.","zh":"我想待在家里悠闲地看书休息。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"집에서","meaning":"家，屋","explanation":"집：家，屋；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"2","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한가롭게","meaning":"闲暇，闲适","explanation":"한가롭다：闲暇，闲适；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"한가롭다","audio":"/audio/8f002145af6c12cb555b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84077","senseId":"1","lemma":"한가롭다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"책을","meaning":"书，书籍，画册","explanation":"책：书，书籍，画册；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"책","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71468","senseId":"1","lemma":"책","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"읽으며","meaning":"阅读","explanation":"읽다：阅读；으며：表示同时进行或并列；与 도 合用可表示“同时却、尽管”。","readings":[{"term":"읽다","audio":"/audio/f843025cff483034e05a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68752","senseId":"2","lemma":"읽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쉬고","meaning":"休息，歇","explanation":"쉬다：休息，歇；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"쉬다","audio":"/audio/62b3b824836a1f2cb1c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71280","senseId":"1","lemma":"쉬다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"싶어요.","meaning":"要，想","explanation":"싶다：要，想；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"싶다","audio":"/audio/b3ad33de22cbca646dc1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62657","senseId":"1","lemma":"싶다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家，屋","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"数人或动物为了生活而盖的建筑物的单位。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"8f002145af6c12cb","term":"한가롭다","zh":"闲暇，闲适","audio":"/audio/8f002145af6c12cb555b.mp3","entryId":"84077","definition":"不忙，有余暇。","pronunciation":["한가롭따"]},{"id":"ba928dd573a2db9e","term":"책","zh":"书，书籍，画册","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3","entryId":"71468","definition":"把文章或画印刷之后装订成册而成的物品。","pronunciation":["책"]},{"id":"f843025cff483034","term":"읽다","zh":"阅读","audio":"/audio/f843025cff483034e05a.mp3","entryId":"68752","definition":"看文字了解其意思。","pronunciation":["익따"]},{"id":"62b3b824836a1f2c","term":"쉬다","zh":"休息，歇","audio":"/audio/62b3b824836a1f2cb1c5.mp3","entryId":"71280","definition":"为去除疲劳而使身体舒适。","pronunciation":["쉬ː다"]},{"id":"b3ad33de22cbca64","term":"싶다","zh":"要，想","audio":"/audio/b3ad33de22cbca646dc1.mp3","entryId":"62657","definition":"表示有做前面内容的意图或欲望。","pronunciation":["십따"]}],"audio":"/audio/54261daa6346764ecf84.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.442,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=84077","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":164,"sequenceScore":3.2687,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我想待在家里悠闲地看书休息。","这个寒假你有什么计划吗？","时间不早了，我该回家了。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这个寒假你有什么计划吗？","时间不早了，我该回家了。","我想待在家里悠闲地看书休息。"],"answer":2}]}
